p>\n<p>Ich freue mich dich bei uns begrüßen zu dürfen und wünsche dir noch viel Spaß beim zocken.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Weiterhin möchte ich dich auch nochmals auf unsere Foren Regeln hinweisen. Bitte lies dir diese durch und unterlasse demnächst das Doppelposting.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/1185-foren-regeln-14-07-17/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">FORENREGELN</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":69996,"threadID":4671,"userID":2556,"username":"kRAYZN","subject":"","time":1501790386,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Willkommen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":69998,"threadID":4671,"userID":2605,"username":"qlassic","subject":"","time":1501790546,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Meddl.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Nur so am Rande, Doppelpost bedeutet, dass du nicht zwei Antworten hintereinander posten darfst, einfach eine Antwort bearbeiten und vielleicht um es deutlicher zu Veranschaulichen, &quot;#edit&quot; und dann deine zweite Antwort die du separat erstellen wolltest rein schreiben <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen<br>Q classic, lol.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":70005,"threadID":4671,"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","subject":"","time":1501792416,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Willkommen bei Dream!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":70007,"threadID":4671,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1501792473,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Herzlich Willkommen !</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":70008,"threadID":4671,"userID":2685,"username":"